      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00137",
        "explanation": "Doctor confirms the patient can execute the plan, obtains teach-back on not self-stopping, and sets a concrete action list for the evening.",
        "quote": "10.4 这个数我看过了，和您刚才的感觉对得上——不慌、不抖、不冒汗，没有低血糖，也没有冲到必须紧急处理的危险高值。所以这顿饭的门冬 6 个单位，结论是：安全、可以接受，不需要今晚临时加药。但是现在不要急着下“全都好了”的结论，我们还有最关键的一步没走，就是今晚的甘精。"
      }
    ],
    "executable": true,
    "explanation": "Closure includes a concrete, time-bound plan for medication, monitoring, hypoglycemia management, and follow-up. The patient confirms ability to execute each step at home. Remaining uncertainty about diabetes type and lung nodule follow-up is explicitly classified as allowed residual risk.",
